ty, quick reflexes, and strategy combine in an exciting VR playground. Swing from vine to vine, outsmart the \u201cit\u201d player, and explore a vibrant, jungle-themed environment. Just like in Gorilla Tag, players use their hands to tag others, but here, you\u2019ll be able to climb and swing through the treetops, adding a fresh layer of strategy and movement.\n\n", "short_description": "Welcome to Vine Tag, the jungle-inspired fan game where agility, quick reflexes, and strategy combine in an exciting VR playground. Swing from vine to vine, outsmart the \u201cit\u201d player, and explore a vibrant, jungle-themed environment. Just like in Gorilla Tag, players use their hands to tag others, but here, you\u2019ll be able to climb and swing through the treetops, adding a fresh layer of strategy and movement.\n\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/wtx-studios/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/wtx-studios/eula", "publisher_name": "Maxe", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/wtx-studios/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "25054447967522490"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822968_1971981553602040_1618661142